WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:11.881 --> 00:00:13.926
[Negan]
Previously onDead City.

2
00:00:14.101 --> 00:00:15.817
[The Croat] With the methane.
we can bring the city back.

3
00:00:15.841 --> 00:00:17.001
[Negan] Right around the time

4
00:00:17.104 --> 00:00:18.627
that the world turned into
shit soup.

5
00:00:18.757 --> 00:00:21.064
The Croat showed up at my door.

6
00:00:21.195 --> 00:00:24.067
Said that I made him feel safe.

7
00:00:24.198 --> 00:00:26.287
[Dama]
He murdered your husband.

8
00:00:26.417 --> 00:00:27.657
-[Negan grunts]
-[Maggie grunts]

9
00:00:29.464 --> 00:00:32.075
Just look after Ginny. will ya?

10
00:00:32.249 --> 00:00:33.511
No!

11
00:00:33.642 --> 00:00:35.774
[Dama] Our world
has been destroyed.

12
00:00:36.558 --> 00:00:38.995
