14
00:00:55.142 --> 00:00:56.882
[hammer pounding]

15
00:00:57.231 --> 00:01:00.843
[eerie music continues]

16
00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:03.759
[Soldier] Hey. who are you?
You're not supposed to be here.

17
00:01:03.889 --> 00:01:06.501
[referee whistle blows]
Do you hear that?

18
00:01:06.849 --> 00:01:09.156
Maybe we should get in there.

19
00:01:09.286 --> 00:01:14.074
No... Sarge told us to hang
these up all around. come on.

20
00:01:14.639 --> 00:01:15.640
Lead the way.

21
00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:18.730
You lead the way.
Always tellin' me what to do.

22
00:01:19.557 --> 00:01:22.560
[gunshots]
[people shouting]

23
00:01:22.646 --> 00:01:24.780
[tense music]
[wind whipping]

24
00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:29.785
[tense music continues]
[shouting]

25
00:01:36.531 --> 00:01:40.100
[walkers growling]

26
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:48.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
